  m_text: "A game by Orsoniks\n<size=20><color=#9999>hi! thank you for playing and supporting this project of mine.\nit started out as a small vent game around mid-2024 and it is amazing to see how far it has gotten since, with so many eyes looking at it.\ni hope it can mean to you as much as it does to me!!\n"
