      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "With other creative assistance from goip (Connor Marr)\n<size=20><color=#9999>I worked on the game in mostly 2025, previously just doing fanart until Orson took interest in my work. I prototyped art for the game such as for earlier iterations of the death screen, among giving feedback for general creative design among thematic / narrative stuff. It’s been a privilege to help bring the game’s vision to light, and I look forward to maybe helping in another someday."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ef15b4a1e8af3ae46bfcb652b838e97e, type: 2}
